# What the image does not need.
#
# The database and uploads are NOT excluded. The Dockerfile seeds /app/data
# from them at build time, so the first `docker compose up` on a fresh volume
# comes up with the site as it looks now rather than empty. Once the named
# volume exists it takes over and the image's copies stop being consulted.
#
# The backup IS excluded: it holds every account and the test password that was
# in use locally, and an image is the wrong place for either.
filehub.db.backup-*
*.backup-*

# Development leftovers.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.log
server.log
tmp_*
_probe*
.venv/
venv/
env/

# VCS and editor cruft.
.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Docs are for the repository, not the running image.
开发总结.md
DEPLOY.md
README.md
docs/
